WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow
I'm in a complete daze under the sun

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow
Guided only by my flowering love for you

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Hirakeyo inochi no hana
Let the flower of life bloom

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Akaku atsuku midasarete
Let it follow its red hot desires

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
Fujouri na mirai no kodou
This flame runs through the pulses

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Kakenukeru honoo
Of the absurd future

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.570
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne
I feel it tingling inside me

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.070
Yokubou
Desire

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:45.780
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:50.700
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru
And turns into great pleasure

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:56.540
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto
I'm sure you don't know yet

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.300
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:08.260
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai
I want to hold on to these newborn desires

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.560
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne
More wild than soft

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.730
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa
That will make my day

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:21.270
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.190
Dare ga mamoru
That I can only see for myself?

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:29.700
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo
I can do it, so love me truly

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.490
<b>The Slasher's</b>

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.490
<b>True Identity</b>

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:38.330
Oh? You're back?

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.920
Mataemon, I hope you didn't die again.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:43.630
Mataemon?

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:48.840
What are you doing?!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:53.100
Tell me! Where is the stone?!

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.020
What nonsense are you spouting?!

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:08.190
What's your problem?

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.110
That's <i>my</i> line.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.160
What stone were you talking about?

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:17.990
What? A stone? What are <i>you</i> talking about?

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.250
You don't remember what you just said?

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.250
I've got no idea.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:24.920
Why don't you go clean your ears?

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:28.170
What <i>was</i> that transformation?

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:29.670
<b>Barrier</b>

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.180
<b>Repairs</b>

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:36.680
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:38.930
Barrier repairs at 99.5%.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:39.810
Rin! Pyo! To! Sha! Kai! Jin! Retsu!

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:44.860
99 hours and 30 minutes until completion. That's four days, three and a half hours.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.290
Go faster. You shouldn't be taking this long.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.910
I'm not sure the chanters can handle it.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.110
We're in a dire situation.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.490
The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.790
Don't overdo it.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.970
You haven't rested much, have you?

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.380
Nia? Are your wounds healed?

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.210
No cause for concern.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:08.930
However, the princess is requesting information about the Guardian Stone.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:09.960
Sen?

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:14.100
There's no need for her to know. Just ignore her.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:19.710
The battle to defeat Amakusa damaged even the Guardian Stone.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.350
My predictions weren't satisfactory.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:26.360
This resulted in the return of the Dark Samurai, and you were injured as well.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:31.490
It's the duty of the Master Samurai to obey their General.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.990
Just a little more.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.810
Once the barrier is restored,

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.830
they will no longer be able to reach the Guardian Stone,

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.130
and peace will return to Great Japan.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.870
I cannot rest until then.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.710
How can he just ignore me?

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:51.950
So Yoshihiko-sama doesn't know about the Guardian Stone, either?

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:56.550
That's just not possible! I'm sure I heard him talk about it.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:59.770
"This and that about the Guardian Stone." I can't remember!

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:06.170
I thought we'd figure out what she wanted if we learned about the Guardian Stone.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:07.980
Houzouin Inshun, huh?

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:13.400
The four Dark Samurai came here saying they wanted to fight someone strong.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.660
We agreed to have a rematch after a month,

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.490
and they've stayed on the Academy grounds since then.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.750
I thought it was in preparation
for the showdown.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.870
That might not be the case.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:31.260
She kept looking for the Guardian Stone by attacking people as the slasher.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:35.390
Does our battle really mean nothing to them?

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:38.680
Or do they need the Guardian Stone <i>for</i> the battle?

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.890
We should just ask Inshun herself.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.560
You're looking for her, right?

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.250
Of course I am!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.390
I've assigned all the special forces units to this task.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.270
It wasn't Inko-chan!

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.650
She's not a bad girl!

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:52.690
Juubei...

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:57.370
If you look at the situation, it's the most reasonable explanation.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.620
That's wrong!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.790
It wasn't her.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.270
Calm down, Juubei!

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.370
Stupid Nii-chan!

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.970
J-Juubei!

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.450
She'll be back once she gets hungry.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.530
Muneakira.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.690
The battle that will happen in three days will determine

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.720
both your powers as a General and the future of this dojo.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.610
Even if we can't be sure that the battle is going to happen,

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.560
I want to be completely prepared.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.450
The Samurai Bride holds the key to victory.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:34.390
We have to thoroughly investigate the documents from the Tokugawa mansion.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.320
Sen, what about you?

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.550
How about some training?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.670
Sounds good.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.870
Matabei and Hanzou are training too.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.830
They're training?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.330
<b>The coal burner</b>

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:49.960
<b>Practice</b>

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:51.590
No!

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.840
I'm sorry, Matabei-san!

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.680
It's the same as before.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.350
I studied a lot in preparation,

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:04.990
but when it comes down to it...

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:05.810
I understand.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:09.850
But next time, I'll be sure to become a Master Samurai!

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:12.570
Yes. We must overcome this obstacle!

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:16.790
That voice...

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.200
We're getting troublesome company.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:23.530
You gave up after just a few minutes? You disappoint me!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.530
What do you want here?

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.540
Are you stealing training ideas again?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:31.540
I-It's not like I was doing qi training or anything.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:37.150
After all, I don't need <i>any</i> training.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.800
Um, Kanetsugu-san.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.810
We beg you, please don't disturb us.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:49.560
Do you really think two inexperienced girls doing that would <i>actually</i> count as training? I hope not!

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.310
Th-That reminds me.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.610
Kanetsugu-san...

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:57.810
Yeah! I'm a Master Samurai!
That means I'm experienced!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.630
Even Kanetsugu-san beat me to it.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.570
It's humiliating.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:06.450
I'm <i>much</i> more of an adult than you two are!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.830
Should I tell you what I know about kissing?

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.080
Do you mean it?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.580
<b>Kanetsugu</b>

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:15.010
Secret of Kissing

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:19.330
In my case, I carefully led that beast Muneakira to me

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.970
and managed to perform a perfect kiss!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:22.930
Huh?

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:25.310
Didn't he forcibly kiss <i>you</i>?

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.350
Yeah, that's what he said.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.980
Because I led him to forcibly kiss me!
That's the technique!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.190
I see.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.440
So such a technique exists.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:40.820
I bet you couldn't even imagine it, considering how you know nothing about a real kiss!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.510
Real...

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.700
...kiss...

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:46.780
Muneakira-san, I beg you.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.270
Please make milady your Samurai Bride!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.890
I can't promise that.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.580
After all, I have you!

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.270
W-We mustn't!

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:01.650
Compared to milady, I'm nothing.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:04.750
Be honest with yourself, Hanzou-san.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.330
No!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:10.930
No! No! No!

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:12.770
What are you doing?!

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:17.860
Why is this happening to me?

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.090
I know very well that I don't deserve it.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:25.240
I'm so tall, and my body's too muscular.

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:28.590
But for the sake of fighting the Dark Samurai...

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:30.910
I understand, Matabei-san.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.200
You're beautiful.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:37.040
Ah, we mustn't do that, Muneakira-san!

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.690
We mustn't! We mustn't!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:42.630
M-Matabei-san?

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:47.640
<b>At the shrine</b>

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.630
I'm sure it's not like that.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.810
Inko-chan can't be the culprit.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:58.810
What's up, Fake?

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:02.210
Or not. You really were Yagyuu Juubei.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.240
Mucchan? What're you doing here?

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:07.930
I just saw you run away crying.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:11.990
Mucchan, what should I do?

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:15.500
<b>At the teahouse</b>

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.590
Huh? Inshun is the slasher?

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.250
The others all think so.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.250
No way! It has to be a misunderstanding.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.130
I know, right?

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:28.010
Inko-chan's a good girl!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:31.260
Why would Inshun do something like that in the first place?

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:36.270
Wait. She <i>has</i> been going out a lot recently.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.940
What's wrong, Mucchan?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.270
Don't worry.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:45.230
If one of my pals is the culprit, I'll smash her myself.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.790
Cowardly attacking people as the slasher would be a disgrace to all samurai.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:51.570
Mucchan...

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:56.040
For me, the battle with you guys is the top priority.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.770
Do your training properly!

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:04.300
I wanna fight a strong Yagyuu Juubei.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.300
Thank you, Mucchan.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.800
I'll train as hard as I can!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.930
Hey. Call Inshun here.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.150
Don't ignore me.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.310
What if she's really...

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:24.820
<b>The Slasher</b>

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.490
It's begun!

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.240
Wh-What's that?!

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.370
Mataemon?!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.170
What's going on here?!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:46.670
<b>Yagyuu Dojo</b>

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.670
<b>Strategy meeting</b>

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:54.510
It's clear that the slasher still doesn't know the location of the Guardian Stone.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:58.750
That means there's a high chance that she will appear again tonight.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.010
We must confirm her goal...

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.520
and try to use it to our advantage in the battle against the Dark Samurai!

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:09.490
Luckily, it seemed like I was stronger than her
once I became a Master Samurai.

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:12.030
That's thanks to our qi training too.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:16.950
You two should make your move tonight after becoming Master Samurai.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:18.410
Yes. That's what I was thinking.

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:21.010
Hanzou-san, Matabei-san,

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:24.530
please work with the special forces to gather details about the sightings.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.270
As you wish.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.050
Understood.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:29.260
Okay, then. Let's all be very careful.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.370
Yeah.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.530
Just leave it to us!

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:33.880
This time she won't get away.

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:38.520
What is this unrest in my heart?

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:42.140
Some gargantuan power is lurking out there.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.610
There, huh?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:52.150
If Inshun's doing anything stupid like that, I'm gonna beat the crap outta her!

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.290
You're hungry, too, Sacchin?

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:02.330
I was hoping to meet Inko-chan again by coming here.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.590
Looks like it was a waste of time.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.090
The slasher?

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:13.150
It's that time already?

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.100
We should go home before everyone starts worrying about us.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:19.850
<b>The Five-Storied Pagoda</b>

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:24.850
Inshun!

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:29.570
What are you doing here?

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:31.230
What I must.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.990
So it <i>was</i> you?

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.870
The hell are you doing before our important battle?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:43.750
Bastards who attack the weak from the darkness are not samurai!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:49.170
You're not getting away!

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:53.300
Look!

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.470
Dark Samurai!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:12:59.970
What's that?

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.970
Is that Inko-chan?

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:05.710
Thanks for the meal!

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.490
Juubei's late.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:11.490
Yeah. I thought she'd be back for dinner.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.570
I'm worried, so I'll go and look for her.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:17.990
Guys! We found Inshun!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:19.700
What?

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.950
She's at the five-storied pagoda near the Sanjou bridge.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.460
The direction she's headed...

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.790
Does this have something to do with them?

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.630
Let's see where this goes.

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.790
Be careful out there!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.390
Of course!

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:39.790
Leave it to us!

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:42.300
Wait for me!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.390
Wait, Hanzou-san!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:49.900
I understand that you want revenge, but we'd only get in the way if we went there!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.520
I'm sorry.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:56.900
We should cooperate and provide everyone with accurate intel.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:57.610
As you wish.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.200
What's this?

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:15.090
Tell me where the Guardian Stone is, Tokugawa Sen!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.470
What's wrong, Sen?

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:20.840
Sorry, go on ahead!

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:25.190
Then the prey is mine!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:26.610
Wait, Kanetsugu!

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.270
Don't run off alone! It's dangerous!

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.270
This way.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.250
Was there really a qi signal?

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.020
Yes.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.280
Where is Tokugawa Sen?!

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:39.470
This is bad.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:42.280
We should run before its qi hits us.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:46.370
How dare you talk about milady like that?
You'll pay for your actions!

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:49.290
Give me Tokugawa Sen!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.110
Hanzou-san!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:50.750
Let it be!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:00.170
Oh no!

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.510
Hanzou-san!

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.720
You two, get back!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.720
Princess Sen!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.210
Lightni-

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:08.930
Hanzou!

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:12.140
Found you, Tokugawa Sen!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:13.900
Crap!

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:17.710
Princess Sen!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.900
Oh no!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.290
Dammit!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.370
Muneakira-san, please recall Yukimura-sama.

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.660
Telepathy!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.290
Stop, Kanetsugu!

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.300
The slasher's at the Yagyuu dojo!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:41.300
We're going back!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.550
Princess Sen! Hanzou-san!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.430
It's pointless, Muneakira-san.

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:49.990
Once caught, they can no longer move.

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.930
A Tokugawa princess should know!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.480
Where's the Guardian Stone?

00:15:57.060 --> 00:16:00.510
Let me look into your memories!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.280
These are my memories from after the battle with Amakusa.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:09.290
How bad is the damage?

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.210
What? The barrier?!

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:15.630
And the Guardian Stone?
What about the Guardian Stone?

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:19.170
Sen! How long have you been there?

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.630
I'm busy now. Come back later.

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:24.130
O-Of course.

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:29.100
I see. That map must've shown the location of the Guardian Stone.

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:31.650
Dammit! What do we do now?

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.510
Muneakira-san, please kiss me.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:39.020
Please, make me a Master Samurai!

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.990
I believe Yukimura-sama will understand.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.150
That's a Master Samurai!

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:49.830
Matabei?

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:13.970
Purging Seal!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:14.980
<b>Purge</b>

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.060
Fool!

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:23.190
Do you want to hurt your comrades too?

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.450
What?!

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:33.250
What's that creepy thing?

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.410
Hanzou-san, are you okay?

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:36.410
Yes.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.270
More importantly, milady is...

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:40.040
Matabei-san, free Princess Sen!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.910
Leave it to me.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:45.880
Once again, taste the power to purge all that is wicked!

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:51.430
Damn you! You're all gonna die here!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:53.770
True Seal! Monk Brush Spear!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.400
The Tokugawa princess is mine!

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:06.810
This is bad.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.710
She can't use her abilities like this!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:09.870
Milady!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.690
Tokugawa Sen!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:15.580
I'll take you and all your memories!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:17.190
S-Save me!

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:20.670
Muneakira... Hanzou...

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:23.920
Muneakira-san, I beg you!

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.090
Give me the power to save milady!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.270
Okay!

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:52.120
A-Amazing. I can clearly see the qi's flow!

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:57.250
Matabei-san! Jump on my mark and save milady!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.120
O-Okay.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.310
Here we go.

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:00.250
Three seconds.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.080
Two. One.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:02.750
Now!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.380
Shuriken Dance!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:15.050
Dream on!

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:19.100
Now, Matabei-san!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.110
Purging Seal!

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:32.110
What are you looking at?!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.120
Damn, she got away.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:44.410
What's that evil qi?

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.090
So she wasn't the culprit?

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.090
What?

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:55.470
Araki Mataemon?

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:57.550
Huh? What?

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.190
What am I doing here?

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.600
I've got no idea.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.930
We're going for now, Mataemon.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:06.310
Huh? S-Sure...

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.710
Damn, they got away!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:13.740
<b>The next morning</b>

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:16.160
So what happened to the culprit?

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.770
Unfortunately, she got away.

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:20.990
What were you even doing?

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.950
Give us a break! We were up against the Dark Samurai!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.130
Geez.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:30.510
But as you said, Juubei, it wasn't Inshun.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.330
Don't be so quick to decide that.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:40.350
Yeah. Mataemon and Kojirou are both her fellow Dark Samurai.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:41.890
R-Right.

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:45.130
But what could be their purpose?

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.440
In my opinion...

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:53.900
the battle with the Yagyuu dojo is just an excuse for them to stay on campus.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.910
Their highest priority is the Guardian Stone.

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:00.530
I'm inclined to agree with her.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.990
But what <i>is</i> the Guardian Stone?

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:07.450
Maeda Keiji taught us about qi
so that we could save this country.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.990
That's what she said.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.710
To save Great Japan?

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:15.050
So the Guardian Stone is protecting the country itself?

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:16.640
Then what about the Dark Samurai?

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.030
If I may venture a guess,

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:22.330
their goal might be to destroy the Guardian Stone

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.640
and thus destroy Great Japan.

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:26.610
What?!

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:27.350
No way!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.980
What does that mean?

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:32.430
Destroy... Great Japan?

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.740
Episode Nine

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:12.960
The Guardian Stone, huh?

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.380
I wonder where it is.

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:20.350
It must be hidden well and
<i>really hard</i> to find, I believe.

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:21.870
No pun intended.

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:25.370
What if it was attacked?

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:29.170
I bet it would've hurt so bad, it would've <i>sucked</i>.

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.890
No pun intended.

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:32.980
Next time: The Secret of the Guardian Stone.

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:37.190
By the way Gisen, isn't this the first time you've appeared in the preview?

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:38.430
It certainly takes some <i>balls</i>.

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:39.990
No pun intended.
